;; skjema — clj-kondo.
;;
;; `defmask` and `defslot` are this repository's own macros
;; (src/com/blockether/skjema/core.clj): each defs one private constant - the
;; bits a keyword lights up, and the array position its value is prebuilt into -
;; so the linter reads them as the `def` they expand to. Without this the masks
;; and slots are 79 unresolved symbols and the report is noise.
;; The tests speak lazytest's `clojure-test` interface, whose `deftest` the
;; linter otherwise reads as an unresolved symbol per test.
{:lint-as {com.blockether.skjema.core/defmask clojure.core/def
           com.blockether.skjema.core/defslot clojure.core/def
           lazytest.experimental.interfaces.clojure-test/deftest clojure.test/deftest
           lazytest.experimental.interfaces.clojure-test/testing clojure.test/testing}}
